    {"id":"U04","program":"set -u -- -x ''; printf '%s|<%s>|<%s>\\n' \"$#\" \"$1\" \"$2\"; set --; printf '%s\\n' \"$#\"","question":"-- replaces/clears positionals and preserves empty","basis":"G1/P1"},
    {"id":"U05","program":"set -- a b; set -; printf '%s:%s\\n' \"$#\" \"$1\"; set - c; printf '%s:%s\\n' \"$#\" \"$1\"","question":"Lone- positional behavior","basis":"P1"},
